ected = \"A complete attended review or critique brief has no unfilled slot and carries the shipped review clauses, lane facts or scope rubric as applicable. An empty test list, invalid round shape, missing specification, unreadable or empty named input, unfilled template slot, malformed or unbound verdict (without exactly one line whose keyword, compared case-insensitively, is VERDICT in the canonical form `VERDICT: <APPROVE|CHANGES-REQUESTED> findings=<digits>`), a lane branch the round reader cannot read as a review scope, and a lane whose scope is the rollup generator's own directory are refused without a requested file or review record. A bracketed non-severity bullet beside N declared-severity findings and findings=N is filed, and its rollup shows N. A detached lane, non-commit revision or non-ancestor base returns exit 2 with no output file and a clean repository. A successful review returns exit 0 and writes only its brief with full resolved revisions and the reviewed tip; successful filing returns exit 0 and adds only the next review-round record. A valid filed review is rendered in the lane review history.\""," automated = \"Yes\"","-evidence = \"tests/test_review_brief.py::test_a_rendered_review_brief_carries_the_kit_clauses_and_the_lane_facts; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_a_narrow_round_names_the_findings_it_answers; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_a_narrow_round_without_findings_and_a_full_one_with_them_are_refused; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_a_named_input_that_is_not_there_refuses; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_an_unfilled_slot_refuses_and_no_brief_is_written; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_the_scope_critique_carries_ruling_twos_questions_and_its_rubric; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_a_filed_coordinator_review_appears_in_the_rollup; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_a_malformed_review_is_refused_and_nothing_is_filed; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_a_round_with_no_tests_refuses; tests/test_review_brief.py::test_an_empty_or_missing_na